killed_after_timeout
kill_failed
not_running
sigterm_fallback
no_battle_map
window_closed
same_side
no_side
already_held
insufficient_authority
not_your_commitment
side_mismatch
no_such_season
no_world
world_database_unavailable
nl_disabled
co_commander
observed_only
deny_area

