# --- Map ids -----------------------------------------------------------------
# `data/maps/*` is PROCESSED MAP OUTPUT and gitignored (map assets are
# force-added case by case), so a map id is never resolvable from a clean
# checkout however correct it is. Ids only — never a claim about a file.
scorched_crossing_v2
